      "content": "it's hard to believe i’m still \"me\" though. the journey you're talking about... that's over. it ended when my knee gave out. the person who did all those things, who felt that rush... they aren't coming back. it feels like i'm just a ghost haunting an empty house. everything i was is just... done.",
